<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>แบบประเมินสุขภาพจิตและสมองผู้สูงอายุ — โครงการ อสม. ฮีลใจ</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Kanit:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

<style>
  :root {
    /* Theme Colors From Page 2 System */
    --forest: #1E4A34;
    --forest-deep: #123324;
    --sage: #8FAE86;
    --sage-soft: #E4EEDD;
    --marigold: #E8A23C;
    --marigold-deep: #C8801F;
    --ink-main: #24301F;
    
    /* System & Card Specific Colors */
    --sky: #BFE6F5;
    --mint: #CDEEDB;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --surface-alt: #F4F8F5;
    --ink: #1A2B27;
    --ink-soft: #4B615B;
    --teal: #2E9C8F;
    --coral: #D35400;
    --coral-soft: #FBEFE8;
    --danger: #C0392B;
    --line: #E3F1F5;
    --radius: 24px;
    --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(30,80,90,0.12);
    --font-scale: 1;

    --display-font: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
    --body-font: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
  }
  
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { font-size: calc(16px * var(--font-scale)); scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background:
